index e99ba6c..64aab4e 100644
--- a/00_START_HERE.md
+++ b/00_START_HERE.md
@@ -215,3 +215,51 @@ In the event of a staging rollback:
    npm run build
    PORT=3004 npm run start -- -p 3004
    ```
+
+---
+
+## Appendix: Context Engine Research QA Integration
+
+> **Integration Branch:** `antigravity/ctw-v2-frontend-integration-rehearsal`
+> **Integration Commit:** `7dca3e4` (1 commit ahead of V2 baseline `84d9712`)
+> **Status:** Feature-flagged, disabled by default
+
+### What Was Integrated
+
+The Context Engine public document research capability is now wired into the V2 application:
+
+| Component | Location | Purpose |
+|:---|:---|:---|
+| Server Proxy | `apps/web/app/api/employer/research-qa/route.js` | Supabase auth + org authz + scoped engine call |
+| UI Panel | `apps/web/components/research/ResearchQAPanel.jsx` | Question input, status badges, citation inspector |
+| Brief Mount | `apps/web/app/employer/brief/[id]/page.jsx` | Panel mounted in role brief workspace |
+| Research Route | `apps/web/app/employer/brief/[id]/research/page.jsx` | Dedicated full-page research view |
+| API Tests | `apps/web/__tests__/api/researchQA.test.js` | 6 security & integration unit tests |
+| Component Tests | `apps/web/__tests__/components/ResearchQAPanel.test.jsx` | 4 rendering & interaction tests |
+
+### Enabling the Research Panel
+
+1. Set `NEXT_PUBLIC_ENABLE_RESEARCH_QA=true` in `apps/web/.env.local`
+2. Set `WORKBYLINE_ENGINE_URL=http://127.0.0.1:8000`
+3. Set `WORKBYLINE_INTERNAL_SERVICE_KEY=your-scoped-key`
+4. Set `WORKBYLINE_RESEARCH_WORKSPACE_ID=ws_8b9eb121caea4a55`
+5. Start the Context Engine: `cd experiments/readily_gemini_benchmark_v3/engine && uvicorn app.main:app --port 8000`
+6. Start the V2 app: `cd apps/web && npm run dev`
+
+### Running Integration Tests
+
+```bash
+cd apps/web
+npx vitest run __tests__/api/researchQA.test.js __tests__/components/ResearchQAPanel.test.jsx --reporter=verbose
+# Expected: 10 passed (10)
+```
+
+### Security Boundaries
+
+The proxy route enforces fail-closed behavior at every layer:
+- **Feature flag off:** HTTP 403 `RESEARCH_QA_DISABLED`
+- **No session cookie:** HTTP 401 via Supabase `requireUser()`
+- **Wrong organization:** HTTP 403 via database membership check
+- **Engine unreachable:** HTTP 503 `SERVICE_UNAVAILABLE`
+- **Request timeout:** HTTP 504 `GATEWAY_TIMEOUT` (15s deadline)
+- **No Gemini key:** HTTP 503 `BLOCKED_PENDING_KEY_ROTATION`
-- 
2.50.1


