From: Darshil Parmar <darshilparmar@Mac.lan>
Date: Fri, 23 Oct 2026 02:37:56 +0530
Subject: [PATCH 5/8] fix(integration): address nine independent review
 findings and harden context engine contract

- Finding 1: Enforce server-owned tenant & run mapping; eliminate client workspace authority and memberships[0] default.
- Finding 2: Enforce fail-closed configuration without hardcoded token fallbacks.
- Finding 3: Purge mock provider answers from normal application route.
- Finding 4: Implement strict upstream request/response contracts; reject object answers and validate citations.
- Finding 5: Tie research context to verified hiring run; replace 'Grounded & Verified' with 'Source-Grounded'.
- Finding 6: Formalize paired rollback rehearsal with separate provenance, archive, and disposable DB checks.
- Finding 7: Qualify landing page marketing claims; align copy with human-review brief definition.
- Finding 8: Provide reproducible code structure, fail-closed contracts, and layered acceptance evidence.
- Finding 9: Reconcile release commit history, untracked symlink documentation, and test suite counts.
